    <node id="&quot;UNITED STATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">The United States is a North American nation characterized by its diverse agricultural practices, environmental challenges, and specific regulations regarding beekeeping and mushroom cultivation.</data>
